674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i434_aH4G2IQ7kNvwFJ92CH&_nc_oc=Adoy0qdvLUruuYHLbcYPE_UPXslkdx2yTZaiTlYp6QETKPeKDPv3OU7arCVfzEIy2-w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1HMin_mkm1UuJf4m9740X-35KyWv5Vp9xQBif43adaAw&oe=69E24459"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fhfoa_wbsyAQ7kNvwE6H9tc&_nc_oc=AdqexzANqxI_nVLMqdhhhiKLNuexhQk0J4NfnK8CgiLLQz6yMC5zK0ro4joaWvwPmiM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0YD6NMxxTDMx6VHE06cCe5y3bFv5tgnkdJ-rcDMjbOoA&oe=69E24D16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cbiWSC29oO0Q7kNvwFe1ZD3&_nc_oc=Ado26Mkm6ZXdotDLaHf7L13efSSHOHnVNHWEl2WPLda2F8WroSyYd-PNnd9mZNnWYpE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1jcn86zNkOwWp10hv5vQNYja3ThKjRA0jfdrMtS4-3zQ&oe=69E24931"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip